abstract: "EarthSphere is an executive planetary and deep space intelligence platform uniting 13 official NASA Open APIs with the God's Eye View photorealistic 3D tactical console. Visualizes active natural disasters, solar storms, near-Earth asteroids, live global aircraft ADS-B vectors, AIS maritime vessels, orbital satellite constellations, and hands-free voice operations using Next.js 15, Three.js, CesiumJS, and Google Photorealistic 3D Tiles."
